agnitude. (<italic>d</italic>) Average RT differences. (<italic>e</italic>) Scatter plot showing perceived synchrony (PS) differences, relative to PS estimates concerning disparity changes of 0.07&#x000b0;, as a function of disparity change magnitude. (<italic>f</italic>) Average PS differences.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="rspb20070576f01"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>